            "meaning_en": "is it or not?"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "八块",
            "pinyin": "bā kuài",
            "meaning_en": "eight yuan"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "十八块",
            "pinyin": "shíbā kuài",
            "meaning_en": "eighteen yuan"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "人民币",
            "pinyin": "rénmínbì",
            "meaning_en": "renminbi"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "美金",
            "pinyin": "měijīn",
            "meaning_en": "US dollars"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "给你",
            "pinyin": "gěi nǐ",
            "meaning_en": "here you are"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "太多",
            "pinyin": "tài duō",
            "meaning_en": "too much"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "不够",
            "pinyin": "bú gòu",
            "meaning_en": "not enough"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "没有",
            "pinyin": "méiyǒu",
            "meaning_en": "do not have"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "guided-speaking",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "text": "Speaking task: Ask for a newspaper, verify its price, explain your currency problem, then close politely."
      }
    ],
    "practice": {
      "enabled": true,
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q-dialogue",
          "kind": "comprehension",
          "prompt": "What price does the shopkeeper confirm?",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "八块人民币。 (Bā kuài rénmínbì.) — Eight yuan.",
          "explanation": "Do not confuse eight with eighteen."
        },
        {
          "id": "q-translation",
          "kind": "production",
          "prompt": "Ask if the shop has American newspapers.",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "请问，你们有没有美国报纸？ (Qǐngwèn, nǐmen yǒu méiyǒu Měiguó bàozhǐ?) — Excuse me, do you have American newspapers?",
          "explanation": "Use 有没有 (yǒu méiyǒu) for availability."
        },
        {
          "id": "q-grammar",
          "kind": "production",
          "prompt": "Ask for confirmation that a newspaper costs eighteen yuan.",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "这份报纸是不是十八块？ (Zhè fèn bàozhǐ shì bú shì shíbā kuài?) — Is this newspaper eighteen yuan?",
          "explanation": "The 是不是 (shì bú shì) form asks for confirmation."
        },
        {
          "id": "q-speaking",
          "kind": "production",
          "prompt": "Ask for a newspaper, verify its price, explain your currency problem, then close politely.",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "A: 您好，请问有报纸吗？ (Nín hǎo, qǐngwèn yǒu bàozhǐ ma?) — Hello. Do you have newspapers?\nB: 有，一份八块。 (Yǒu, yí fèn bā kuài.) — Yes, eight yuan each.\nA: 是不是十八块？ (Shì bú shì shíbā kuài?) — Is it eighteen yuan?\nB: 不是，是八块。 (Bú shì, shì bā kuài.) — No, it is eight yuan.\nA: 我只有美金，没有人民币。我一会儿再来，谢谢！ (Wǒ zhǐ yǒu měijīn, méiyǒu rénmínbì. Wǒ yíhuìr zài lái, xièxie!) — I only have dollars, no yuan. I will return shortly, thanks!\nB: 不客气，再见！ (Bú kèqi, zàijiàn!) — You are welcome. Goodbye!",
          "explanation": "A complete buying exchange covers availability, correction, payment and farewell."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
